WEBVTT

00:01:42.410 --> 00:01:43.700
Lag!

00:01:43.700 --> 00:01:45.760
Where are we going tomorrow for delivery?

00:01:45.760 --> 00:01:48.050
Tomorrow I actually have a rare day off-duty.

00:01:48.050 --> 00:01:50.100
I get a vacation from deliveries.

00:01:50.100 --> 00:01:51.710
You can sleep-in too, Niche!

00:01:52.490 --> 00:01:53.430
Sleepin?

00:01:53.430 --> 00:01:54.200
Yup!

00:01:54.200 --> 00:01:57.030
Okay! Tomorrow I'll try to sleepin!

00:01:57.030 --> 00:02:00.220
I have to make sure to 
finish the letter bullet.

00:02:01.010 --> 00:02:04.500
I was thinking about asking Sylvette 
to give me advice tonight.

00:02:05.400 --> 00:02:09.550
Dolly

00:02:10.380 --> 00:02:12.310
That's a nice funny-face!

00:02:12.580 --> 00:02:14.220
We're home!

00:02:14.820 --> 00:02:15.610
They're back!

00:02:17.180 --> 00:02:18.760
Lag, welcome home!

00:02:18.760 --> 00:02:20.570
We're home, Sylvette.

00:02:20.570 --> 00:02:22.880
Good work today too, Niche, Steak.

00:02:23.370 --> 00:02:27.250
Ah, yes... You've got mail, Sylvette.

00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:28.870
A letter?

00:02:28.870 --> 00:02:30.310
I wonder who it could be from?

00:02:30.310 --> 00:02:32.500
Oh? Where's Zazie and Connor?

00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:34.750
It seems like they're out on 
delivery and won't be back tonight.

00:02:34.750 --> 00:02:36.380
I see. That's too bad.

00:02:36.380 --> 00:02:38.650
Then, I'll get dinner ready right away!

00:02:37.740 --> 00:02:39.500
Um, Sylvette...

00:02:40.710 --> 00:02:45.660
After dinner, I was wondering if you could 
give me some advice about the letter to Gauche...

00:02:46.060 --> 00:02:49.240
I'd love to hear old stories 
about how he used to be.

00:02:49.240 --> 00:02:51.900
Stories about me and my brother?

00:02:51.900 --> 00:02:56.040
Sure, no problem. Let's talk 
in my room after supper.

00:02:56.040 --> 00:02:56.860
Yeah.

00:02:56.860 --> 00:02:59.480
Niche, you're covered in sand!

00:02:59.480 --> 00:03:01.650
Change your clothes before you eat!

00:03:02.830 --> 00:03:06.500
My name is M. Croce, and I 
live in the town of Dogra.

00:03:06.500 --> 00:03:08.530
I'm a 10 year old girl.

00:03:08.530 --> 00:03:11.880
Ever since I saw them at the 
shop "Catan" on Nocturne Hood,

00:03:11.880 --> 00:03:16.040
I've fallen in love with the 
dolls you create, Miss Suede.

00:03:17.100 --> 00:03:18.710
Is this a fan letter?

00:03:19.100 --> 00:03:21.240
Oh? That's awesome!

00:03:21.240 --> 00:03:24.270
Catan is the shop that you sell 
your dolls to, right Sylvette?

00:03:24.550 --> 00:03:26.200
What's it say next?

00:03:26.200 --> 00:03:27.730
Um...

00:03:27.730 --> 00:03:31.980
I wrote you this letter today because 
there is a favor I just have to ask you.

00:03:32.410 --> 00:03:38.970
I want you to make a doll that looks like 
me by the 12th bell of the 110th day.

00:03:38.970 --> 00:03:42.640
Huh? The 110th day? That's tomorrow.

00:03:43.100 --> 00:03:47.980
A family member suddenly has 
to go work in the coal mines.

00:03:48.330 --> 00:03:55.040
I want to give him a doll that looks 
just like me, so he doesn't get lonely.

00:03:55.300 --> 00:03:57.050
What a kind little girl.

00:03:57.350 --> 00:04:01.210
But isn't making one from 
scratch by tomorrow impossible?

00:04:01.490 --> 00:04:03.860
Ask her for the address of the mine.

00:04:03.860 --> 00:04:07.430
The only way is to send the doll 
as a letter after it's finished.

00:04:10.610 --> 00:04:11.980
Sylvette?

00:04:15.510 --> 00:04:18.730
Um... I was pretty sure 
I put it around here...

00:04:19.760 --> 00:04:20.920
There it is!

00:04:24.310 --> 00:04:28.120
If I fix her up, I think I can 
make this work... Probably...

00:04:28.120 --> 00:04:30.900
But I have to rework it quite a lot.

00:04:30.900 --> 00:04:34.550
I need to change the hair color to black, 
and change the stones I use for the eyes as well!

00:04:34.900 --> 00:04:36.760
Hey, Sylvette...

00:04:36.760 --> 00:04:39.060
About the letter bullet...

00:04:39.060 --> 00:04:41.190
I should have some fluorite 
that's already been cut.

00:04:41.190 --> 00:04:42.950
If I use that...

00:04:42.950 --> 00:04:45.590
Ah, if only I had pre-sewn some lace...

00:05:17.630 --> 00:05:21.050
In the end, I couldn't write anything...

00:05:21.050 --> 00:05:23.210
'Morning, Sylvette.

00:05:23.210 --> 00:05:25.540
The light was on all night, so...

00:05:25.540 --> 00:05:27.830
I made sandwiches, so eat those, okay?

00:05:28.100 --> 00:05:31.250
I'm going to Dogra to deliver the doll now.

00:05:31.550 --> 00:05:34.570
Huh? You finished the doll?

00:05:34.570 --> 00:05:35.480
Okay, thanks!

00:05:37.260 --> 00:05:39.350
T-Thanks for...?

00:05:39.350 --> 00:05:40.920
I'm off!

00:05:41.420 --> 00:05:43.670
Hey-wha-Sylv...

00:05:43.670 --> 00:05:46.470
So sleepy... What am I...

00:05:46.470 --> 00:05:49.110
Something is gonna...

00:05:49.110 --> 00:05:52.140
Niche is trying to sleep in...

00:05:52.140 --> 00:05:54.490
I don't have any pants on.

00:05:54.490 --> 00:05:56.610
I can't open my eyes...

00:05:57.190 --> 00:05:59.320
Huh? They're already open?

00:06:02.240 --> 00:06:04.380
Wait, Sylvette!

00:06:05.300 --> 00:06:07.400
I would be fine by myself!

00:06:07.400 --> 00:06:12.260
I lived all by myself from when my brother 
went to the capital until you came, Lag.

00:06:12.260 --> 00:06:16.890
I know that, but if you want 
to deliver something, tell me.

00:06:16.890 --> 00:06:18.790
Today is your day off, right, Lag?

00:06:18.790 --> 00:06:19.830
Yeah, but...

00:06:19.830 --> 00:06:24.050
I want to hurry. I've got to deliver 
the doll today by the 12th bell!

00:06:25.690 --> 00:06:28.410
There's a carriage to the town of Dogra.

00:06:28.410 --> 00:06:29.760
See, that's the problem.

00:06:30.380 --> 00:06:34.800
A bunch of letters have been stolen 
in that direction. It's dangerous.

00:06:34.800 --> 00:06:38.110
If you board it and get the doll 
stolen, don't come crying to me!

00:06:38.110 --> 00:06:40.560
Lag, what are you mad about?

00:06:41.460 --> 00:06:43.040
I-I'm not mad about anything...

00:06:44.250 --> 00:06:46.170
Oh? Then, I'm counting on you.

00:06:49.410 --> 00:06:52.180
So this means... You're my dingo, Lag!

00:06:52.440 --> 00:06:56.680
Sure, whatever... "As your 
dingo..." "As your dingo..."

00:06:57.400 --> 00:06:59.980
Speaking of which... What about Niche?

00:06:59.980 --> 00:07:01.230
As your...

00:07:01.570 --> 00:07:03.230
Lag? Lag!

00:07:03.230 --> 00:07:04.310
Lag!

00:07:04.310 --> 00:07:06.490
Lag didn't sleepin!

00:07:09.140 --> 00:07:10.080
Lag?

00:07:13.950 --> 00:07:16.710
A rhino carriage is coming! Let's get on it!

00:07:16.710 --> 00:07:19.120
I'm going to leave you behind, dingo Lag!

00:07:19.120 --> 00:07:21.120
She's fast... I think she 
doesn't need a dingo.

00:07:21.120 --> 00:07:24.620
Hold it! Wait up, Sylvette!

00:07:30.650 --> 00:07:33.430
The usual Candy Phillips Lights...

00:07:34.020 --> 00:07:36.180
And, you got anything else, Emu-kun?

00:07:37.100 --> 00:07:41.680
I've got some nice, fresh, 
local-area info, Mr. Lloyd.

00:07:41.680 --> 00:07:43.350
Ooh, you got it.

00:07:43.350 --> 00:07:45.630
I think you'll find it to your liking.

00:07:46.150 --> 00:07:49.030
I'd say it's well worth two bills.

00:07:49.470 --> 00:07:51.430
These are some expensive smokes.

00:07:51.970 --> 00:07:55.400
You disappoint me, Emu, and 
your punishment will be swift.

00:07:55.570 --> 00:07:56.750
Sca-ry.

00:07:57.330 --> 00:07:58.530
Please, come to the back.

00:08:01.580 --> 00:08:04.270
So that's the doll that looks like the girl?

00:08:04.270 --> 00:08:08.840
Yup. I didn't have a chance to double 
check everything before leaving the house.

00:08:09.090 --> 00:08:12.340
Buttons: Check. Lining: Check.

00:08:12.340 --> 00:08:15.630
Amazing... You made that in one night?

00:08:15.630 --> 00:08:20.110
And I couldn't write a single line 
of Gauche's letter that whole time!

00:08:20.110 --> 00:08:22.950
I see! So that's why you were mad, Lag.

00:08:23.570 --> 00:08:27.510
It was because I made the doll 
instead of helping you out.

00:08:27.510 --> 00:08:28.230
No, it wasn't...

00:08:28.860 --> 00:08:30.110
I'm sorry, Lag.

00:08:30.740 --> 00:08:33.240
But wait... Were you jealous?

00:08:33.490 --> 00:08:35.410
N-No, that's not it!

00:08:36.570 --> 00:08:40.990
You could always make that doll later.

00:08:41.370 --> 00:08:48.000
But the letter bullet might be the 
only way to get Gauche's heart back.

00:08:48.000 --> 00:08:51.920
Isn't it your wish for 
Gauche to come back, Syl...

00:08:58.060 --> 00:08:59.950
Sylvette?

00:09:05.740 --> 00:09:07.820
S-She's sleeping...

00:09:08.520 --> 00:09:11.630
That's right... She was up all night.

00:09:12.590 --> 00:09:14.330
Me, too...

00:09:14.330 --> 00:09:16.990
Where might you dearies be heading for?

00:09:17.240 --> 00:09:20.150
Um, the town of Dogra.

00:09:20.150 --> 00:09:24.620
I'll wake you up when we arrive. Now, 
you get to sleep too, young man.

00:09:25.700 --> 00:09:27.300
Are you sure?

00:09:27.300 --> 00:09:31.060
It's only natural to help out those in need.

00:09:31.930 --> 00:09:34.260
Lag! Where are you, Lag?

00:09:36.050 --> 00:09:37.970
I smell Sylvette!

00:09:39.360 --> 00:09:40.690
Lag!

00:10:02.450 --> 00:10:05.340
They sure are sound asleep.

00:10:05.340 --> 00:10:08.060
So then, shall we get started?

00:10:10.230 --> 00:10:11.960
No need to play coy!

00:10:12.210 --> 00:10:16.550
You wanted to have some private time 
together so we could get it on, right?

00:10:17.470 --> 00:10:20.560
Get... it... on!

00:10:20.560 --> 00:10:22.290
Time for some sloppy kisses!

00:10:30.140 --> 00:10:34.850
Come out all this way and the only people on 
board are a couple 'o brats and some pervy old man.

00:10:34.850 --> 00:10:36.610
Times are rough, man...

00:10:36.920 --> 00:10:41.700
Although the full carriages are 
watched by the vigilante patrols...

00:10:41.700 --> 00:10:45.160
Well, I guess I'll get 
something for this rubbish.

00:10:47.390 --> 00:10:50.950
The Lone Thief, Autobahn, is here!

00:10:51.330 --> 00:10:54.420
Although I've never told anyone 
that name, so no one knows.

00:10:55.030 --> 00:10:56.090
Ciao!

00:11:03.220 --> 00:11:05.840
Ow! Oww!

00:11:06.310 --> 00:11:08.170
I hit my head...

00:11:09.970 --> 00:11:11.940
Owww!

00:11:13.310 --> 00:11:15.050
You're not an old lady!

00:11:16.560 --> 00:11:17.500
That's...

00:11:17.920 --> 00:11:19.350
My doll!

00:11:19.350 --> 00:11:21.280
Are you a thief?

00:11:22.270 --> 00:11:24.940
Sleep a bit longer, you damn brats!

00:11:25.760 --> 00:11:27.200
I don't think so!

00:11:27.200 --> 00:11:27.700
What?

00:11:28.220 --> 00:11:30.200
I'll protect Sylvette!

00:11:30.820 --> 00:11:32.330
Because I'm her dingo!

00:11:34.280 --> 00:11:35.560
Damn you!

00:11:38.500 --> 00:11:39.260
Wait!

00:11:39.510 --> 00:11:41.590
Give back Sylvette's doll!

00:11:41.840 --> 00:11:44.200
Why you... Let go, you damn brat!

00:11:44.200 --> 00:11:45.970
Give back the doll!

00:12:00.140 --> 00:12:01.030
Lag!

00:12:06.280 --> 00:12:07.950
Oww...

00:12:10.800 --> 00:12:12.150
The doll?

00:12:16.830 --> 00:12:18.570
It's down there?

00:12:19.610 --> 00:12:21.350
Lag!

00:12:24.110 --> 00:12:25.230
Lag!

00:12:25.230 --> 00:12:28.470
Sylvette, I'm fine. Stay back.

00:12:30.350 --> 00:12:32.400
Be careful, Lag!

00:12:32.750 --> 00:12:34.560
What are you doing? Don't!

00:12:34.560 --> 00:12:37.530
Shut it and hand me the reins!

00:12:38.980 --> 00:12:40.470
That thief!

00:12:44.150 --> 00:12:45.480
Are you okay?

00:12:47.900 --> 00:12:49.600
Sayonara, you damn brat!

00:12:53.310 --> 00:12:54.550
What a horrible man!

00:12:54.550 --> 00:12:56.190
Help me!

00:12:56.190 --> 00:12:59.500
Please help me!

00:12:59.500 --> 00:13:00.780
The old man?

00:13:01.180 --> 00:13:02.830
Is that the same person?

00:13:04.630 --> 00:13:05.840
I've had just about enough!

00:13:09.200 --> 00:13:12.300
If it's a chase you want... 
You picked the wrong opponent.

00:13:19.230 --> 00:13:22.980
Do you think you can escape 
from the wheelchair leopardess?

00:13:25.910 --> 00:13:28.400
It's no use... I can't get any closer.

00:13:29.800 --> 00:13:31.200
What should I do?

00:13:31.600 --> 00:13:33.050
Lag!

00:13:33.800 --> 00:13:35.120
That voice...

00:13:36.900 --> 00:13:39.250
Niche, why are you here?

00:13:39.250 --> 00:13:40.970
Where did you go, Lag?

00:13:40.970 --> 00:13:43.460
Why did you go off doing secret deliveries?

00:13:43.460 --> 00:13:45.950
Where did you go after making Niche sleepin!

00:13:46.850 --> 00:13:48.050
Uh... Right here.

00:13:51.140 --> 00:13:52.840
That's the Nocturne!

00:13:52.840 --> 00:13:54.520
You brought it with you?

00:13:54.520 --> 00:13:56.090
That's my Niche!

00:13:56.920 --> 00:13:58.060
I'm you're...

00:13:58.060 --> 00:14:02.910
That's it! I just need to shoot the doll 
with a shindan and knock it up over the cliff.

00:14:02.910 --> 00:14:04.380
Hand it over to me, Niche!

00:14:06.650 --> 00:14:11.470
Thanks. Niche, grab the doll 
and give it to Sylvette.

00:14:11.470 --> 00:14:12.850
Understood!

00:14:16.460 --> 00:14:19.140
Shindanjuu Nocturne Op. 20...

00:14:19.140 --> 00:14:20.620
Shindan Loaded!

00:14:20.620 --> 00:14:21.990
Red Needle!

00:14:29.920 --> 00:14:31.070
Niche!

00:14:32.120 --> 00:14:33.940
I'm being promoted to the capital, Akatsuki!

00:14:35.180 --> 00:14:38.660
When I'm in Akatsuki, I'm going 
to become Head Bee, you'll see!

00:14:39.730 --> 00:14:41.910
These are the doll's memories?

00:14:42.210 --> 00:14:43.560
But...

00:14:44.690 --> 00:14:48.580
If I become the Head Bee, I'm sure 
I'll find a cure for your legs!

00:14:49.070 --> 00:14:54.000
I'll save up a ton of money! I'll 
work and work and save up a fortune!

00:14:57.100 --> 00:14:58.350
Sylvette...

00:15:09.740 --> 00:15:11.110
Sylvette...

00:15:15.120 --> 00:15:17.480
I don't need anything, so...

00:15:17.480 --> 00:15:20.210
I don't care if I can never walk... Just...

00:15:20.470 --> 00:15:22.190
Please don't go!

00:15:22.500 --> 00:15:23.690
Brother...

00:15:24.180 --> 00:15:27.320
The heart that Sylvette put into this doll...

00:15:27.980 --> 00:15:28.900
Sylvette.

00:15:29.630 --> 00:15:31.400
May I have that ribbon?

00:15:32.920 --> 00:15:34.410
You want to use it?

00:15:35.850 --> 00:15:39.810
I just thought that if I had something like it,

00:15:40.330 --> 00:15:42.410
I could feel like I was closer to you,

00:15:43.220 --> 00:15:46.160
even though we'll be separated.

00:15:51.290 --> 00:15:52.350
Here.

00:15:52.600 --> 00:15:54.020
Thank you.

00:15:58.610 --> 00:16:01.330
Even though we're separated, we're close.

00:16:06.080 --> 00:16:09.300
That's it! I'll make a doll to give him!

00:16:10.930 --> 00:16:14.030
So that I can always be 
near him to cheer him up.

00:16:14.960 --> 00:16:17.450
And so he never forgets about me...

00:16:17.450 --> 00:16:18.030
Ow!

00:16:19.460 --> 00:16:21.590
A doll that looks just like me.

00:16:23.740 --> 00:16:26.400
You're leaving for the capital today?

00:16:26.810 --> 00:16:28.350
They rushed the schedule.

00:16:28.630 --> 00:16:29.630
I'm sorry.

00:16:30.780 --> 00:16:33.630
When I become Head Bee, 
I'll come to pick you up.

00:16:36.840 --> 00:16:37.770
For sure...

00:16:38.520 --> 00:16:39.980
Brother...

00:16:45.560 --> 00:16:48.340
Brother has been fired from the Bees?

00:16:48.700 --> 00:16:52.590
Gauche is no longer a Letter Bee.

00:16:53.760 --> 00:16:58.220
He lost his heart, and no 
one has seen him since.

00:16:59.530 --> 00:17:01.580
I'm so sorry, Sylvette...

00:17:02.090 --> 00:17:03.580
It's a lie, Aria-san!

00:17:04.130 --> 00:17:05.610
All lies!

00:17:06.410 --> 00:17:07.420
It's a lie...

00:17:08.210 --> 00:17:09.370
A lie!

00:17:13.950 --> 00:17:18.920
I want to give him a doll 
that looks just like me.

00:17:19.290 --> 00:17:22.430
Because I don't know when 
I will see him next.

00:17:23.060 --> 00:17:26.980
I want my beloved brother to have it.

00:17:27.610 --> 00:17:30.260
So that he won't forget about me.

00:17:32.710 --> 00:17:33.860
Finished!

00:17:34.940 --> 00:17:37.790
I finally finished it, Brother...

00:17:40.300 --> 00:17:43.920
I'm so sorry I didn't give it to you...

00:17:53.130 --> 00:17:55.460
Please help me!

00:17:56.190 --> 00:17:57.850
Stop the carriage!

00:17:57.850 --> 00:17:59.490
What's with this brat?

00:17:59.490 --> 00:18:01.100
I ain't gonna lose to no brat like you!

00:18:01.490 --> 00:18:03.470
Stop calling me a brat!

00:18:05.470 --> 00:18:08.420
Hey! Go faster!

00:18:09.630 --> 00:18:11.050
Eat this!

00:18:11.050 --> 00:18:16.930
You're about to taste Sylvette's 
Hip Slide Blinder Attack!

00:18:31.300 --> 00:18:33.290
Not all brats are the same, you know!

00:18:33.650 --> 00:18:34.910
Don't underestimate us!

00:18:39.680 --> 00:18:42.120
The Lone Thief, Autobahn?

00:18:42.120 --> 00:18:43.500
Never heard of 'im.

00:18:43.500 --> 00:18:46.440
And the moral of the story: 
Don't make Sylvette angry.

00:18:47.900 --> 00:18:50.530
Here, this is the doll you asked for.

00:18:52.330 --> 00:18:53.520
Thanks!

00:18:56.620 --> 00:18:58.050
Brother...

00:18:59.300 --> 00:19:03.030
I will bring back Gauche's heart 
with the letter bullet, I promise.

00:19:04.390 --> 00:19:05.510
Sylvette...

00:19:10.090 --> 00:19:14.400
We've found the trail of the 
Marauder Noir up in the north.

00:19:14.400 --> 00:19:15.700
Gauche?

00:19:16.080 --> 00:19:19.560
This is worth investigating, Aria-kun.
